!
! The people across this node's spaces (meadow_rules.h MR4), in Trebago:
! the exact sum of pspace.members' count of each space, one space per row,
! this node counted in each it is in. For integers min(1, max(0, m + 1))
! is 1 exactly when m >= 0, so ok is 1 when a count is 0..33 (32 members,
! vna_space.h VNA_SPACE_MEMBERS, and this node), else 0, and each row is
! divided by it: a count outside is a division by zero and refuses the
! whole sum.
trebago members
  in  members(n)
  out total
  var ok(n)
  ok(i) = min(1, max(0, members(i) + 1)) * min(1, max(0, 33 - members(i) + 1))
  total = sum(i, members(i) / ok(i))
end
